<title>CHINA: Sewing Machine 1996 net up 51.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Sewing Machine 1996 net up 51.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover	   424.496	 vs	 512.475</p>
<p> Net profit	   6.677	 vs	   4.404</p>
<p> Net asset per share     3.31 yuan    vs   3.24 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share     0.034 yuan    vs   0.023 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Industrial Sewing Machine Co.</p>
<p>Note: The results were published in a company statement.</p>
<p>All figures are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed a three-for-10 bonus issue for all shareholders from the company's reserves, pending approval of shareholders, the statement said.</p>
</text>
